# Operator Module Final Test (OMFT)

When the user wants a **reusable live operator final test** of any product module (not only one surface):

1. Read and follow: `.cursor/skills/operator-module-final-test/SKILL.md`
2. Phases:
   - **PREP** → module pack + run brief under `docs/team/ux-feedback/`
   - **YOU RUN** → human only
   - **INTAKE** → `USER-NAV-REPORT-*-omft.md` via `navigation-user-feedback` shape
   - **IMPLEMENT** → only after approved `NAV-…` IDs (`live-fix` / `ship`)
3. Do not invent findings in PREP. Do not implement without approved NAV-IDs.

## Triggers

- `OMFT`, `OMFT prep:`, `OMFT intake`, `OMFT implement`
- "module final test", "operator final test", "corrida final de módulo"
- "prepará el pack de prueba", "mapa del módulo para la corrida"

